  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "經濟與生活",
    "sub_ename": "ECONOMY AND LIFE",
    "describe_ch": "在現代的經濟社會，人們的生活與各種經濟活動息息相關。經濟學為一理性選擇的社會科學，並廣泛的應用在各領域。本課程的目的為使學生具有基本的經濟學知識，及培養學生分析經濟問題的能力。課程內容包含二部分：\r\n1.先以課堂講授方式介紹經濟學的基本知識，並提供各種現實經濟數據及案例，使學生了解經濟學於現實生活中的應用。\r\n2.再以問題導向式學習(PBL)，以實際的經濟案例培養學生自主學習經濟學及分析問題的能力。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "In the current economic society, people’s life is highly related with economic activities. Economics is a social science of rational choice. It has been prevalently applied in various fields. The purpose of this course is to help students to have basic knowledge of economics, and to bring up the ability of analyzing economic problems. The course contents include two parts:\r\n1.Introducing basic knowledge of economics via class teaching, accompanying with various real-world cases and data, to help students to understand the application of economics in real life.\r\n2.Using Problem-Based Learning (PBL) to help students to bring up the ability of learning economics and analyzing economic problems from the economic case in the real world.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "學習經濟學的基本知識，及如何分析國內外經濟問題。",
      "describe_en": "To learn basic knowledge of economics, and how to analyze domestic and foreign economic problems."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "應用PBL培養溝通合作能力，及能自主學習經濟學及分析經濟問題。",
      "describe_en": "To bring up the ability of communication and cooperation by applying PBL so as to independently learn economics and analyze economic problems."
    }
  ],
